{"seq":46,"slug":"percolation-theory","title":"渗流理论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"渗流理论-随机连通如何在临界点骤然贯通\">渗流理论：随机连通如何在临界点骤然贯通</h1><p>往一块方糖里滴咖啡，液体会不会渗到底？往一片森林里随机点火，火会不会烧穿整片林子？把一张电网里的变电站随机敲掉一部分，剩下的还连成一张网吗？这些看似无关的问题，背后是同一个数学结构：在一个随机保留连边（或节点）的巨大网格上，是否存在一条贯穿全局的连通路径。渗流理论正是研究这种「随机连通」的数学，它诞生于 1957 年 Broadbent 与 Hammersley 对煤矿防毒面具中气体穿透多孔介质的建模，如今已成为概率论、统计物理与网络科学交汇处最活跃的分支之一。</p>\n<p>渗流最迷人的地方在于「相变」：当保留每条边的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 从小到大连续变化时，系统的宏观连通性并不是平滑地增强，而是在一个精确的临界值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处骤然出现一个横跨整个系统的「无穷团簇」。低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一切连通块都是有限的碎片；高于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，几乎必然存在唯一的贯通结构。这个从「碎裂」到「贯通」的突变，是最干净、最可解析的相变模型，也让渗流成为理解磁性、超导、玻璃化等真实物理相变的数学实验室。</p>\n<p>本 hub 按「为什么—临界—标度—应用」四条主线递进组织。<strong>基础</strong>篇建立直觉与语言：渗流回答什么问题、键渗流与位渗流两类模型如何定义、相变现象为何存在。<strong>临界</strong>篇聚焦临界点本身：临界概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的精确值与计算、团簇大小的分布规律、无穷团簇的存在性与唯一性定理。<strong>标度</strong>篇进入临界点附近的普适世界：一组临界指数如何刻画奇异行为、为何千差万别的系统共享同一套指数（普适性）、临界团簇的分形几何与连续渗流的 SLE 理论。<strong>应用</strong>篇把理论带回现实：复杂网络的鲁棒性、材料导电与流行病传播的渗流映射、以及数值方法与理论的适用边界。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：渗流的概率语言（样本空间、独立性、随机变量）在 <a href=\"../probability-statistics/\">概率统计</a> 中系统建立，本 hub 只用不重讲；渗流本质是随机图上的连通性，图与连通分量的基本概念属于 <a href=\"../graph-theory/\">图论</a>，网络鲁棒性一章会借用其巨连通分量语言；渗流临界点的标度与普适性思想同 <a href=\"../nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/\">非线性动力学与混沌</a> 的分岔、分形维数共享统计物理内核；连续渗流用到的布朗运动与 SLE 驱动函数扎根于 <a href=\"../stochastic-processes/\">随机过程</a>。本 hub 专注「随机连通的相变」这一核心，其余只做一句点到加交叉链接。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：完全新手按 基础 → 临界 → 标度 → 应用 顺序通读；有概率与图论背景的读者可直接从「临界概率」切入，把基础篇当索引；做网络科学或工程应用的读者读完基础篇后可跳到应用篇，需要时回查标度篇的指数定义；对数学结构感兴趣的读者应重点研读标度篇的分形团簇与 SLE。<strong>前置知识</strong>：初等概率（独立事件、期望）、图的基本概念（节点、边、连通分量），标度篇会用到幂律、标度关系与少量重整化群直觉，但正文都会就地解释，不预设统计物理训练。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：把「随机连通」讲成一门数学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-percolation","title":"为何渗流理论：随机介质中的连通性问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations/why-percolation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"connectivity-models","title":"键与位渗流模型：定义、格点与术语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations/connectivity-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"phase-transition","title":"相变直觉：连通性为何会骤然跳变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/foundations/phase-transition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"critical","title":"临界：把「突变点」钉死在数轴上","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/critical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"critical-probability","title":"临界概率：pc 的定义、精确值与计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/critical/critical-probability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cluster-sizes","title":"团簇大小分布：从指数衰减到幂律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/critical/cluster-sizes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"infinite-cluster","title":"无穷团簇与唯一性：Burton–Keane 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/critical/infinite-cluster"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scaling","title":"标度：临界点附近的普适几何","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/scaling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"critical-exponents","title":"临界指数：刻画奇异性的幂律家族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/scaling/critical-exponents"},{"seq":2,"slug":"universality","title":"普适性：为何细节无关、只看维数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/scaling/universality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fractal-clusters","title":"分形团簇与 SLE：临界几何的精确刻画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/scaling/fractal-clusters"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"应用：从抽象格点回到真实世界","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-robustness","title":"网络鲁棒性：渗流视角下的韧性与脆弱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/practice/network-robustness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"materials-epidemics","title":"材料与流行病：两个经典渗流映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/practice/materials-epidemics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"percolation-in-practice","title":"应用与边界：算法、有限尺寸标度与适用极限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/percolation-theory/practice/percolation-in-practice"}]}]}